# Append-only audit logs: union-merge so two branches that both append a line
# (e.g. an emergency `SKIP_TEST_BASELINE=1` commit on each side) keep BOTH lines
# on rebase/merge instead of producing a textual conflict. The log is a tracked,
# deliberate audit trail (NOT gitignored); union-merge preserves every entry.
# DoE re-review 3a / N-3 (2026-06-15): this log conflicted on every rebase
# before this attribute existed.
/.test-baseline-overrides.log merge=union
